            <h3>Tactile-Driven Manipulation</h3>
            <p>
              Designing multi-modal tactile sensors (vision, touch, audio) and developing contact-aware policies that leverage haptic feedback for robust manipulation.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="research-area">
            <h3>Large Behavior Models</h3>
            <p>
              Scaling foundation models to manipulation through cross-embodiment learning and multimodal sensing.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="research-area">
            <h3>Data Strategy for Robot Learning</h3>
            <p>
              Building scalable data collection frameworks, evaluation methodologies, and best practices for training generalizable robot policies.
            </p>
